{"annotations":{"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Query the compute market console"},"description":"The Compute Market Intelligence Console's query, as an agent call: one query object (filters as a tree of field, operator and value; group by; metric; time range; sort; page) in, the same result the console draws out: matching list price lines (GPU rental per GPU-hour, model tokens per million, power per MWh; the metric chooses which) with change figures, headline numbers with 30-day change, a league table ranked by any dimension, a chart series, contracts, events, index series, participants and every source. Prices are each provider's own, one line each, never averaged. Fields: provider, chip (GPU, e.g. h100-80), model (a model or its maker), region, geo, price_type, line, venue, status, layer (ids, with in or nin); usd_per_gpu_hour, usd_per_instance_hour, usd_per_gib_hour, gpus, gpu_memory_gib, change_30d, change_12m (gte, lte, between); first_listed (dates); text (contains). Any console URL can be turned into this object.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"__schema0":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"children":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"enum":["provider","chip","model","instance","region","geo","price_type","line","venue","status","layer"],"type":"string"},"op":{"enum":["in","nin"],"type":"string"},"value":{"items":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]{0,63}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["field","op","value"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"enum":["usd_per_gpu_hour","usd_per_instance_hour","usd_per_gib_hour","gpus","gpu_memory_gib","change_30d","change_12m"],"type":"string"},"op":{"enum":["gte","lte","between"],"type":"string"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"items":false,"maxItems":2,"minItems":2,"prefixItems":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"number"}],"type":"array"}]}},"required":["field","op","value"],"type"